Package: krubus-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KRubus Project <https://github.com/GamingTux/KRubus>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/KRubus
Depends: krubus-default-settings, plasma-desktop, plasma-workspace, kwin-wayland, sddm, dolphin, konsole, systemsettings
Recommends: firefox, vlc, ark, kde-spectacle, filelight, partitionmanager
Description: KRubus KDE Plasma 6 Desktop Metapackage (Pi 5)
 This metapackage depends on all core desktop components, hardware tuning,
 power profile daemon, and system optimizations that make up the full KRubus
 Linux desktop experience for Raspberry Pi 5, Pi 500 and Compute Module 5.
